// # Const integer mul println
//
// Logline: Print 3 * 4 so emit-wasm can plant a WASI fd_write body of 12.
//
// Setup: No imports. One public main. The body is only println of two INT literals times.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare public main.
//   2. Print 3 * 4.
//   3. Leave no other statements.

pub fn main() { println(3 * 4); }
